Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了拯救世间众人今天也大展正义身手。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元超能力者 罗宾 在此参上！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跨越遥远的次元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了打倒你这家伙我 才来到了这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢反抗我主 暗黑帝王戴德麦克斯大人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胆子不小嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的正义将大行其道！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大·回·拳！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《哈！ 难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王的真身是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在寻找的妈妈……》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下戴德麦克斯的咒印吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.18,0:00:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你们就得对我言听计从了。 哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人家还在睡觉呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个叫罗宾的少年好像{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我一样是从异世界来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？你在说什么啊，那是电视啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电视？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说，那是哈秋。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈秋？总之他……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打开不就行了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下集「汤烟决战 罗宾直到永远」。

Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来就是一飞冲天时间啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.44,0:01:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟谁决斗好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，回去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我今天也要 罗宾的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须亲眼见证。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果他真的是从次元的狭缝中来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那关于我失去的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他很可能也知道些什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 从刚才开始到底在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说 那只是 打喷嚏而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐呐游马 你听说了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾 好像来这一带了呢。什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在海滨地区搭了布景正在录制节目哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家一起去看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种 有点痞痞的感觉真是让人受不了～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 罗宾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也得去见罗宾才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.73,0:02:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾是挺好，但我想决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走啦，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……让我决斗嘛～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真受欢迎啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样可见不到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵，罗宾大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位，看来你们遇到麻烦了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种时候就交给我乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这世上，所有事都有窍门乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}普通人畏畏缩缩的反而会被怀疑乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大大方方走进去看起来就像圈内人乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～好时髦乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}浮野在六本木吃寿司乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之后再去银座、麻布就登顶了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寿司真好吃～ 刷脸进店 出租车！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 难以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个罗宾居然会在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好觉悟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑帝王 死亡麦克斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个声音 是罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿呀 呀啊 就是那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿 呀 嗬！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:05:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有了 是罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是本尊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑帝王 死亡麦克斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天一定要做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑帝王 死亡麦克斯……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是我的敌人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 小心点 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里有死亡麦克斯的手下！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？这是玩偶服啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩偶服？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是做出来的东西罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你会飞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么看都不会飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！要掉下去了…啊啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了糟了糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是从哪儿进来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:06:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来，跟我去警卫室！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是决斗者吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是你的卡组吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～好险！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到居然把卡盒弄丢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者的命根子…简直不可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢啦！帮大忙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，我有件事想拜托你。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我来一场盛大的决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，喜欢决斗吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，算是有点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就现在马上来一场吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳哼…不对。你说真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，我是九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就赶紧来决斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，现在比起决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你帮我问问他知不知道我的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:07:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，我怎么可能认识你这家伙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 啊… 那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.01,0:07:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不就是只蜘蛛嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我 我害怕虫子。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点 把那蜘蛛想办法弄走啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 游马呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经没事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了。 谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！ 什么啊 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明是正义的伙伴却怕蜘蛛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是大家自己塑造出来的幻想啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的我根本不像罗宾那么强也不勇敢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连蜘蛛都抓不住就是个胆小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 大家擅自给我塑造形象
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:08:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说实话 我已经受够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是 像电视里的罗宾那样做出那种举止……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 没有人愿意{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去试着理解真正的我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然我不太懂 但你只要把真正的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展现出来不就好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的吗？ 谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愿意对我说这种话的你是第一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 你 跟我做朋友吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的名字是 奥平风也。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然可以啊 风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就赶紧来场决斗 作为友情的证明吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾！ 谁啊？ 那孩子是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不是说过不许和无关人员说话吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 银河女王…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…我知道啦 妈。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 你根本不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是让粉丝发现你平时的样子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易打造出来的形象就全毁了啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你捧成明星的我这份辛苦你也给我考虑考虑！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就一直 一直 保持罗宾的形象
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活下去就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.79,0:09:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 给我出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 喂… 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是你跟别人说见过风也
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就告你非法入侵！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也！我们是朋友啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以总有一天一定要决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个约定，我怕是守不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没人能救我……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当明星还真是辛苦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么罗宾自称是风也？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是罗宾变成了风也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是风也变成了罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说，罗宾是哈克逊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是电视里的角色，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实并不存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么我是一直被骗了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是风也只是在演罗宾的戏罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}演戏…。那么 连我的事也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我不是说了我怎么可能知道嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 在失落吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 你也会觉得寂寞什么的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂寞是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂寞就是 孤身一人很难受的意思啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}孤身一人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 风也也难受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他在 寻求帮助。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都无法拯救我…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜… 呜呜…。

Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然若无其事地把空罐子随手乱扔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你这家伙是暗黑帝王死亡麦克斯的爪牙吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧　正义的大放送！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你干什么啊　你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想碾死小猫的你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是暗黑帝王死亡麦克斯的爪牙吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧　正义的大放送！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！

Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目击到的人们都说那是人气电视节目的主角{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超能力者罗宾这么说的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的这是本人干的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是有人在故意找茬。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾怎么可能做出那种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾绝对不会做那种事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此，为什么连我也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是打算让我一个人去巡逻吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要证明罗宾的清白。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.05,0:12:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一定是个冒牌货的罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是啊。那个胆小鬼怎么可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没……没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.61,0:13:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……别管我。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}犯人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……跟丢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那毫无疑问是风也。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:14:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙为什么会做出那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去确认真相吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确认？怎么确认？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去履行和风也的约定。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和风也决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他渴望决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是神圣的仪式。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要是决斗者，通过决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能明白彼此的心意。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没人能救我……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能救风也的，只有你。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也……你变成罗宾打算干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你来了啊，游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明叫你别插手。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，自己到底在做什么你清楚吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须回应妈妈的期待。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须消灭暗黑帝王死极王他们……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我是真正的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元超能力者 罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你还不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才是货真价实的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.77,0:15:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元超能力者 罗宾啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一直在守护罗宾的形象的同时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.13,0:15:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样活下去就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然一直纠结到这种地步吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙深信自己才是真正的罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？也就是说他的灵魂从喷嚏的世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再也回不来了是这个意思吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正如你所说，那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许一直都在痛苦着。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈！世间正在等待我的正义
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大展身手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你为什么要妨碍我？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，你也是暗黑帝王死麦克斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爪牙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，罗宾！跟我决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我来让你清醒过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，那就接受挑战吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的，一飞冲天吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的大显身手吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾他……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡的刻印！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡增幅了他心中的黑暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是因为你，总是惹出麻烦来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤野兽战士·美洲狮人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}美洲狮人是罗宾的师父，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是足智多谋的剑术高手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤，轰轰轰轰魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！轰轰轰轰魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击皮尤曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰重拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中计了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！特莱恩·屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在俺的手牌里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有三连星的特莱恩3张时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击过来的怪兽变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，将三连星的特莱恩3只特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！三连星的特莱恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的大手笔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气，3只！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖1张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将2只特莱恩解放，升级召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！异次元超能者 星·罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然是上级召唤！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上级召唤…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过解放场上的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来召唤上级怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 星·罗宾是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放了2只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:18:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级10的最上级怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 三连星的特莱恩的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特莱恩作为上级召唤的素材
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被解放的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将怪兽效果无效
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特莱恩 复活的大手笔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动 太空遨游！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己的场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有异次元超能者 星·罗宾存在的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借那个效果 我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽2张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将3只等级1的特莱恩叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.83！ 银河女王！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了啊 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.37,0:20:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对罗宾他们施魔法加以操纵的强敌。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 对银河女王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.15,0:20:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备魔法 死之极限的咒印！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这张卡 银河女王的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表示形式无法变更{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论任何情况都不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 使用一个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动银河女王的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王 将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让所有怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下个自己的回合为止变成不死之身
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并赋予那次攻击贯通效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　就由我来赐予你们力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给全部怪兽都加上贯通效果吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙……要是隆隆石像被攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力超出守备力的那部分{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.15,0:21:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　野兽战士美洲狮！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示的隆隆石像{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.60,0:21:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合只有一次不会在战斗中被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　贯通伤害你可得接下！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　星之罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正义的大放送！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.73,0:21:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星之！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨力重拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来比起你的一飞冲天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的大度更胜一筹啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完……我的一飞冲天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.95,0:22:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不止这种程度！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来决斗吧！本周的问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合内通常召唤怪兽的数量是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只？2只？还是3只？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾，不，风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.10,0:23:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 No.卡不就是为母亲的咒缚而烦恼痛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.29,0:23:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己的内心本身吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他是孤独的。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.61,0:23:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我把妈妈带来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎！？攻击力8000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利的豌豆已经凑齐了。要赢啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会解开你的诅咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.73,0:24:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下集 游戏王ZEXAL
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.95,0:24:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星之罗宾 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.19,0:24:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是1只。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.63,0:24:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 只要使用魔法 陷阱 怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.93,0:24:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.69,0:24:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能召唤2只以上！

